# Robotics Telemetry (Redis)
# Streaming high-frequency sensor data from AMRs.

# 1. Real-time Pose (Hash)
# Updated 10Hz
HSET robot:pose:R-101 x 15.4 y 22.1 theta 1.57 map_id "warehouse_A"

# 2. Battery Status (String/Gauge)
SET robot:battery:R-101 88

# 3. LiDAR / Camera Stream (Stream)
# Ingesting sensor frames for processing consumers
XADD robot:lidar:R-101 * frame_id 5502 points_count 360 ranges_blob "BASE64..."

# 4. Command Queue (List)
# Scheduling next tasks
RPUSH robot:cmd:R-101 "GOTO x=50 y=10"
RPUSH robot:cmd:R-101 "LIFT pallet_id=P-99"

# 5. Geofence Check (Geo)
GEOADD active_robots 15.4 22.1 "R-101"
# Check proximity to Charging Station
GEODIST active_robots "R-101" "ChargingStation_1" m
